WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:01.650
Here we go!

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:04.320
How's everyone doing out there?

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.790
<i>Frankenstein Family</i> starts today!

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:13.010
<b>Tanisu
 Sugiyama Riho</b>

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:10.640
I play Tanisu, the protagonist.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.300
I'm Sugiyama Riho. Nice to meet you!

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.580
That's all wrong!

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:15.770
Here we go!

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.550
The protagonist is Aisuri.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:22.890
<b>Aisuri
 Mori Nanako</b>

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.470
I play Aisuri. I'm Mori Nanako.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.700
It's nice to meet you.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.680
Hold on a minute!

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:28.310
<b>Suishi
 Ikuta Yoshiko</b>

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.680
I'm Ikuta Yoshiko, and I play 
the <i>real</i> protagonist, Suishi.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.420
Wait, wait, wait!

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.000
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.480
That was very cute, but...

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:31.920
It was cute.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.440
I'm the protagonist.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.170
I am!

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:34.720
No, I am.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:34.720
It's me.

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.180
This is weird! It's weird! 
It's weird! It's me!

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.820
I'm the oldest sister.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.270
We're siblings, so this is important...

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.130
I know! We'll decide with 
rock-paper-scissors!

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:44.490
What, without the other two?

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:46.290
<b>Snow
 Namikawa Daisuke</b>

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:46.290
<b>Ashisu
 Hayami Saori</b>

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.850
Forget those two!

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.530
We'll decide this among ourselves.

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:48.990
Okay. Let's go.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:50.900
Whoever wins gets it.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.040
First comes rock. Rock-paper-scissors!

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.900
Again! Again! Again!

00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:00.030
<b>Frankenstein Family</b>

00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:00.030
<b>Coming up next!</b>

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:58.920
We keep doing the same thing. 
What's going on here?

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:23.210
<b>Frankenstein Family</b>

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:41.990
<b>#1: Family</b>

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:08.980
All done for the day!

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.070
I'm back!

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:28.610
There we go.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:30.810
Thanks, Snow-niisan.

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:33.890
We're back!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.200
Hey, I'm starved! What're we eating?

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.120
Sweet-and-sour pork today.

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:53.450
Stop reading my mind, Suishi-neesan!

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:59.050
I don't need vegetables. Make it all meat.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.300
Ashisu-neesan?

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:08.980
Today's sunlight tastes like strawberries!

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.680
That's not what I was asking...

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:13.690
Hold on. I'll get it ready soon.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.020
<i>Mom and Dad were arrested.</i>

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.610
<i>They're what you'd call mad scientists.</i>

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:25.820
<i>They considered their kids 
to be human guinea pigs.</i>

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.200
<i>I was the one exception.</i>

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.710
We're doing photosynthesis tests.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.040
From now on, you're only 
allowed to drink water.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:32.800
Okay!

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.680
Tanisu, it's time for your studies.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:35.720
'Kay.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.500
Aisuri, when you're done 
with that, it's time to hunt.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:43.140
Got it!

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:46.150
Tanisu, your tutor is here.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:46.950
'Kay!

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:51.720
Stand! Become human!

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:53.560
Too slow.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.560
Tanisu, it's time for your studies.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:56.330
'Kay!

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.680
Put it on. Tell me if you hear anything.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.200
Tanisu, go to bed now.

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:11.620
<i>I didn't realize it until they got arrested,</i>

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:13.620
<i>but keeping a household is hard...</i>

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.620
What is that?

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.120
I see you!

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:33.890
You're not going anywhere!

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:58.830
She's quite the tomboy, isn't she?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.340
I bought all this stuff for us...

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.240
I'll see what that was.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.720
<i>Nothing ever seems to go right...</i>

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.900
Well, should we go out for dinner?

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.990
What'll we get? Cockroaches? Cicadas?

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.560
I don't think we can eat that stuff.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:41.370
Don't worry about me. I only 
need sunlight and water!

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:44.050
I'll pass, too.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:47.110
Really?

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.470
It's noisy outside.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:53.750
C-Come on, there's no sunlight 
at night, and Aisuri needs...

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.780
Forget it, I guess.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:59.860
Just follow me.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.470
<i>Today, famous animation director Miyada</i>

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:07.460
<i>reneged on the retirement
 he announced the other day.</i>

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:10.240
<i>Let's just see how it turns out.</i>

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:14.240
<i>I'd prefer not to have to 
use this medicine again...</i>

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.850
<i>Now for our next story.</i>

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.950
<i>The mysterious explosion on the island
 laboratory several days ago—</i>

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.990
Thank you for coming.

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.990
How many?

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.210
Five, please!

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.080
Here's your tea.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:06.920
What's this about?

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.920
You use it to wash your cup 
before you drink your tea.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:14.800
Like this.

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:26.060
Aisuri-neesan is thinking, "What a pain."

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:28.520
You're thinking it, too, I bet!

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:37.320
That's how you show gratitude to the staff.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.940
Now I'm going to order our food.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:47.160
Put a mark next to the name 
of the food you want to eat...

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:53.010
And we're done!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.870
Look at you, grinning like a fool!

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:56.430
We ain't even eaten yet.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.070
You really must love this restaurant.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:04.430
Tani-chan?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.450
It's just...

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.110
This is our first time...

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:13.650
Eating together like a normal family...

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.800
So what?

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:34.490
It was kind of a dream of mine...

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:40.430
Here you are.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.310
Here it is!

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:50.020
Let's eat it before it gets cold!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:57.280
Wh-Where did this dog come from?

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:00.530
I'm sorry! Forgive me!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.310
Stop that, pup!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.130
Hot, hot, hot!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:22.100
What's with those people? So loud...

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.290
If it's hot, you should use the chopsticks.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.680
Hey, don't spit on it!

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:28.870
Shut up!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:33.120
Ashisu-neesan, you try some, too.

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.440
No, thank you.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.670
Hey...

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.010
Suishi-neesa—

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:40.840
I'll pass.

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:51.210
So annoying...

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.780
That makes me sick.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.380
Annoying.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.090
Who are those people?

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.090
They're freaking me out.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:01.690
I hope they'll leave soon.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.490
Annoying.

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:07.970
Annoying.

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:09.690
I wish they'd just leave.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:10.480
They don't fit in.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.480
They're filthy.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.570
They're gross.

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:14.040
I wish they'd disappear.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.740
That's enough!

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.850
We're not in the lab anymore!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:26.490
We have to live like normal people!

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:30.370
We have no one to rely on. 
We don't have much money.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.400
But you won't even try to 
learn how to be normal!

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:34.540
If you don't change, you'll—

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.610
We'll what?

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:44.790
All you do is complain all damn day.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.450
We ain't normal.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.810
What's the matter with that?

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:54.480
Why do we gotta be your idea of "normal"?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:00.890
What even <i>is</i> your idea of "normal"?

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:13.040
It's...

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:20.800
You've never been out of here?

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.230
The outside world is...

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:31.800
Ever since that day, I realized I wanted 
to live in the outside world with you all.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:38.660
But in the end, 
maybe I was just being selfish.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.910
Snow-niisan. Ashisu-neesan!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.710
Hey, you dumb mutt!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:54.570
My dog side doesn't handle 
this atmosphere well,

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:56.830
and I've always wanted to try chopsticks...

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.930
This is much harder than I imagined it to be!

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:02.710
Tanisu does it so well...

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.890
You'll pick it up right away with practice.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:08.500
See?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:14.940
<i>No matter what life we try to make, 
we'll never stop being who we are.</i>

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.440
Here. For you, too, Aisuri-neesan.

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:28.420
What're you staring at? Got a problem?!

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:31.490
No, everyone just go on and eat!

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:39.670
Delicious!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:45.050
Would you like one of my mushrooms?

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.010
Bring another round!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.050
Fill up the plates!

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:52.600
Can't you slow down?

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:56.390
"If someone makes trouble again, 
this will be our last time eating out,"

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:57.750
Tanisu thinks.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.270
Who do you mean?

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.330
I wasn't thinking that.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.200
I'm having fun being here with everyone.

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:07.130
Suishi-neesan, please don't ruin this!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.780
I really do think it's poor manners,

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:13.830
so you should hold the 
chopsticks with one hand.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.310
See? Like this?

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:17.410
I get it, okay?

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:27.130
The truth is, there's also 
a thing called a fork...

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.770
You use it like this.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:33.310
You oughta show me that crap from the start!

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:40.950
Thank you for coming.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.830
Those people were pretty amazing, huh?

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:50.900
Yeah, all in cosplay and 
doing sleight-of-hand!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.170
What's the matter?

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.210
What's with you?

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:27.780
Was it so expensive it's making you cry?

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.190
It's nothing.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.530
Tanisu...

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.630
I was just remembering some things.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.390
<i>It's tough having such an eccentric family,</i>

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.680
<i>but as long as we're 
together, we'll work it out.</i>

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:43.920
<i>After all, we're family!</i>

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:23.960
<b>Frankenstein Extras</b>

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.630
<i>Frankenstein Extras!</i>

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.270
<i>Today's theme is...</i>

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.960
<b>Today's theme is...</b>

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:30.360
If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.300
No limits on that question, huh?

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:33.930
That's right!

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:35.420
What power would I want?

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.110
Well?

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:39.380
The minute I saw the question, 
something came to mind.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:42.890
<b>Aisuri
Mori Nanako</b>

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:42.890
<b>Suishi
Ikuta Yoshiko</b>

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:42.890
<b>Tanisu
Sugiyama Riho</b>

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:44.570
If I could have just one wish...

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:46.770
I'd want to be a boy.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.380
What? Is that a power?

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:48.880
It is!

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.190
It's about modification, right?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.560
Like how Snow-niisan can 
become a dog, you know?

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.790
I want to become a boy.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:57.490
My feelings for boys transcends "like".

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:58.410
I like boys.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:16:59.130
I like boys.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:16:59.580
Like.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.350
Like.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:01.070
Want to be one!

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:01.560
You?

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:03.040
Yes, I want to be one!

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.320
You don't just want to dote on them?

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:07.500
I want to dote on them, 
yes, and take care of them.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:10.170
But it surpasses that into wanting to be one.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.240
I see!

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:16.030
If that had been the last one we said, 
that would have been a great punchline.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:21.210
But when you start with that, 
nothing we say will be interesting.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:22.260
Not as funny.

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:23.160
Why?!

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:25.570
I voice a lot of boys.

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:28.620
I voice a lot of boy characters,

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.480
so I observe a lot of boys.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:32.320
Like a stalker?

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.360
Like normal. Very quietly.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:38.360
I sit around in parks and watch boys playing.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.150
Isn't that creepy?

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:41.050
It's not creepy! I just people watch.

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:42.480
Don't the mothers think, "What's with her?"

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:43.200
It's fine!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.490
For example.

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:45.690
This is just an example.

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:48.200
You're in the park sitting on a bench.

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.020
If a cat walks by, you watch 'em.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:52.080
You're thinkin' "Oh, how cute, how cute."

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:53.550
'cause it's a cat.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.560
Same with dogs.

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:57.280
It's kinda like that.

00:17:57.280 --> 00:18:00.530
<b>Inexplicable Kansai Accent</b>

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.720
Wait a minute, don't the moms...

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.820
Miho-chan, are you a psychopath?

00:18:03.820 --> 00:18:05.850
No, I'm not! It's normal!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:10.790
The boy characters I play experience 
fun and joy all the time,

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:14.320
but the joy experienced 
by boys in real life,

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.950
like when they're playing 
on a jungle gym and such...

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:22.970
I don't think I could really get 
the feel of it unless I became one.

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.810
So I'd like to be one if I could.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:27.240
Because I'm playing boy roles.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.080
Incidentally, what kind of boy would you be?

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:32.790
Um... Ah... Er...

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.310
Hmm...

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.920
Is it that hard a decision?

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:35.920
I'm really not sure.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.080
I like very quiet little boys.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.330
Oops, I said little boys.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:44.260
I like cheerful, mischievous, 
innocent little boys.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:47.240
And I like pure little boys like Tanisu.

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.310
Please stop saying "little boys."

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:50.240
Sorry!

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:52.360
I love beautiful boys, too.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:53.110
I see.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.720
But what kind of boy I'd 
be is a tricky question.

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:56.990
See, there's characters you like.

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:02.510
You don't quite want to <i>be</i>
 the character you like.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:04.990
You want to become a character 
a little different from that.

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:05.920
I really am a daydreamer.

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.500
But you want to be a boy?

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:11.670
I want to be a boy, so just having 
that ability would be great.

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.000
Is that why you're good at playing boys?

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.960
But I want to be one...

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:21.340
So being able to play Tanisu makes me happy.

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:23.420
I'm happy for you!

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:26.040
I love it. It's so much fun.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.360
Please enjoy Sugiyama's
 wholehearted boy acting.

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:30.820
I hope you enjoy it.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.150
It seems like everyone really enjoys it.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:35.360
It's fun. I really do love Tanisu.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:38.990
But this segment isn't about 
asking people to dote on boys...

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:39.610
Oh, right.

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:45.320
That's right. "What would you want
 to be if you were modified?"

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.830
Right, I got off-topic.

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.980
I get that you'd want to 
be modified into a boy.

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:49.830
Yes, a boy.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:52.890
Was it too powerful? Too powerful?

00:19:51.660 --> 00:20:00.490
<b>If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?</b>

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:55.500
I would want... let's see.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:00.530
I would really want the 
power to sleep anywhere.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:01.840
You can't sleep anywhere?

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:07.880
Well, you know... people who can 
sleep in a moving vehicle and such?

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:09.530
I really admire them.

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:10.160
You can't do that?

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:12.130
I can't sleep like that at all.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:15.900
So if you have an event in Osaka, 
you can't sleep on the train?

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:16.940
I can sleep there!

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:17.860
You can?

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:20.250
You mean more like short naps?

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:21.620
Yes, short naps.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:26.760
How long do you need to get to sleep, then?

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.420
I need about an hour to get to sleep.

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.750
There are people who can fall 
asleep anywhere, you know?

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.040
I can sleep anywhere.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.540
You have what I want!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.320
I really can sleep anywhere.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:40.490
You can?

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:43.560
With just a ten minute 
break, I'm fast asleep.

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:46.290
I sleep so hard I'm drooling.

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.480
Really? I wish I could do that.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:49.760
I think more people have 
that ability than not.

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:51.370
You're delicate.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.560
I'm very delicate.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:57.920
I work here in this location in the morning.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:00.810
Then I go to the next location.

00:21:00.810 --> 00:21:01.780
It tires me out.

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:04.880
If I could just get a nap in then.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.700
It's really refreshing.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.040
Very refreshing.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.970
I understand how you feel.

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:12.760
That's too bad.

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:13.950
It's harder than you'd think.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:15.340
Annoying, right? We work for so long.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.520
It's very hard when you have 
multiple jobs in one day.

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:21.590
It's really exhausting if you have a lot of 
recordings where you really need to focus.

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:23.000
And I don't sleep well.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:24.590
Wow.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:27.890
You need sleep powers.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.470
I don't need modification. I need health.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:32.370
"Health" sounds a little...

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:35.410
I want health.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:39.730
I'd want a modification that lets me 
eat all I like and not gain weight.

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:44.680
<b>If you were going to be modified,
 what power would you want?</b>

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:43.320
Yeah, totally!

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:44.800
The ultimate request.

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:49.120
I love eating, but I put 
on weight very easily.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:52.120
I put on weight so fast. I just balloon up.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:53.450
Depending on how much you eat?

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:58.490
I have a catchphrase: My hobby is dieting, 
my special skill is the rebound.

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:03.400
That's so funny. That's too funny!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:07.800
I always say that when I introduce myself, 
but I'd like to not say it anymore.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:10.630
No more diets.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:12.510
"I can't put on weight, it's so much trouble."

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:15.280
"I can't put on weight, 
no matter how much I eat.."

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:17.740
I've always wanted to say that.

00:22:17.740 --> 00:22:19.980
Then you'll get punched.

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:23.150
But there are some girls so thin they 
want to put on weight, you know?

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:24.490
There are!

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:27.150
They have that metabolism.

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:27.150
I wish I could be that way.

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:30.060
I think all girls want to be that way.

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:31.870
If a modification could do 
that, it's what I'd want.

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:32.880
True.

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:35.320
We're so basic.

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:37.660
So very basic.

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:39.460
That's too practical.

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:42.670
There are lots of abilities out there,

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:46.410
and a lot of them would be great, 
and you'd like to have them,

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:49.510
but they also come with 
problems of their own.

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:50.340
Yeah, they do.

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:54.140
So I think it's best to do your
 best with what you have.

00:22:54.550 --> 00:22:57.210
You sound like a textbook.

00:22:57.210 --> 00:23:00.730
It's best to do what you 
can with what you have.

00:23:00.730 --> 00:23:02.250
Well said.

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:05.080
Let's all do our best with what we have.

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:08.570
<b>Frankenstein Extras</b>

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:08.570
<b>Next week...</b>

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:11.910
I think everyone wants this, but I want ???

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:14.690
What? My heart is pounding now...

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:47.250
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:20.820 --> 00:23:24.750
<i>I'm having trouble getting 
Aisuri-neesan to do what I say.</i>

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:28.010
<i>She says that if I do all the 
housework myself, she'll be good.</i>

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:32.180
<i>Oh, well. I'd better go shopping!</i>

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:35.620
<i>Wait, who's this cute girl?!</i>

00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:39.360
<i>Next time, on </i>Frankenstein Family<i>:</i>

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:47.250
<b>#2: Heartbeat</b>

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:40.330
<i>"Heartbeat."</i>

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:42.180
<i>Catch it, okay?</i>
